💡 Tips
First Run: May take 10-15 seconds to load all stocks

Auto-Refresh: Set to 1-5 minutes in the UI

Paper Trading: Start with small trades to test

AI Usage: Gemini is recommended (free tier)

News Scraping: FeedFlash is the primary source (fixed)

